{"seq":3,"slug":"kernels","title":"核：高斯过程的建模语言","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/gaussian-processes/kernels","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"kernel-functions","title":"核函数 (RBF/Matérn)：把「函数应该长啥样」写成公式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/gaussian-processes/kernels/kernel-functions","wordCount":1416,"readingTime":6},{"seq":2,"slug":"kernel-composition","title":"核的组合：像搭积木一样表达复杂结构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/gaussian-processes/kernels/kernel-composition","wordCount":1321,"readingTime":6},{"seq":3,"slug":"hyperparameter-learning","title":"超参学习 (边际似然)：GP 内建的奥卡姆剃刀","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/gaussian-processes/kernels/hyperparameter-learning","wordCount":1268,"readingTime":6}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"核-高斯过程的建模语言\">核：高斯过程的建模语言</h1><p>前两章里，协方差核 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k(x, x&#x27;)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0019em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 一直被当作一个给定的黑盒——正是它决定了两个输入点的函数值有多相关，从而决定了从先验采样出来的函数是平滑还是崎岖、是周期还是趋势。这一章把黑盒打开：核不是随便选的技术细节，而是你对「目标函数长什么样」的全部假设，是 GP 真正的建模自由度所在。选错核，再多数据也救不回来；选对核，几十个点就能外推出漂亮的结构。</p>\n<p>三节层层递进。<code>1_kernel-functions</code> 是核的字典：RBF 假设无穷可微的光滑函数，Matérn 用一个参数调节粗糙度，周期核编码重复结构，线性核退化回贝叶斯线性回归——每种核对应一族先验函数，我们讲清各自的数学形式与它编码的归纳偏置。<code>2_kernel-composition</code> 是核的语法：有效核在加法与乘法下封闭，于是你能像搭积木一样把「长期趋势 + 季节周期 + 短期噪声」拼成一个结构化先验，ARD 与谱混合核则是自动化这门语法的方向。<code>3_hyperparameter-learning</code> 是核的学习：长度尺度、信号方差这些超参不靠交叉验证蛮调，而是最大化边际似然自动学出——这个目标函数天然内建奥卡姆剃刀，在拟合与复杂度之间自动权衡。</p>\n<p>在 hub 中的位置：这一章解释了回归章预测公式里 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span> 的来源与设计，是把 GP 从「能算」提升到「算得准」的关键。它向下依赖基础章的协方差函数概念，向上支撑实践章——稀疏近似要保持核结构，贝叶斯优化的探索行为直接由核的长度尺度控制。</p>\n"}